   "zh": "自动装备 · UniRig",
   "en": "Auto Rig · UniRig"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "UniRig 是自动装备的统一框架，用大型自回归模型给各类三维资产生成骨架、分配蒙皮权重。这张卡把导入的静止网格绑好骨架和蒙皮权重，交付 USD。",
   "en": "UniRig is a unified framework for automatic rigging that uses a large autoregressive model to generate skeletons and assign skin weights for all kinds of 3D assets. This card rigs the imported static mesh with a skeleton and skin weights and delivers USD."
  },
